        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewisville%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ohio State Route 78 runs through Lewisville, heading east to Woodsfield and northwest to Summerfield.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewisville%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "State Route 145 cuts through the center of Lewisville, leading northeast to Miltonsburg and southwest to Stafford.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewisville%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The village sits in a saddle that is the headwaters of Sunfish Creek, which flows east to the Ohio River, and of South Fork, which flows northwest to the Muskingum River.",
